  "description": "Royalty-free video playback for .NET: reads WebM and Matroska files and the bespoke .cbv container, demultiplexes AV1 video with Opus or Vorbis audio plus text captions and chapters, and drives a codec-neutral video decoder seam, a pinned zero-copy frame-buffer pool, a newest-frame presenter mailbox and a managed SIMD YUV-to-BGRA converter. Audio plays through CodeBrix.Audio; uncompressed video decodes out of the box, while decoders for coded formats and a drawing surface arrive as separate packages, so this one has no native binaries and no drawing dependency at all.",
